            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='19830' id='6' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2567-03-26 at 10.35.25.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='82207' x='684' y='16385'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10339' id='7' type-v2='text' w='98632' x='684' y='6046'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='11'>- This page is to show the intended usage of the dashboard using illustrative examples (the numbers shown are not actuals).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontsize='11'>- Relatively straightforward parts are not explained here.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='11'>1. Overview tab - Which countries are growing the most/least?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'><![CDATA[- The first 2 filters at the top can switch the view between weekly<->monthly and local curency <-> Eur. The default values are set to 'week' & 'Local'.]]></run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- &apos;% growth&apos; figures calculated using  the current period (week/month) runrate vs the last period (week/month).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>- The % growth will give us the highest/lowest growing markets in the current week/month. Based on this information, we can move onto the &apos;country deep dive&apos;.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='7557' id='8' type-v2='text' w='98632' x='684' y='91959'>
